#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:5
#: 947867b3bd0449bd94bc69891bad8e7f
msgid "LOITER to Altitude and QLAND Mode"
msgstr "LOITER 到高度和 QLAND 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:7
#: 1072da985e2147c986b0c1f67c7108ea
msgid ""
"If the previous mode was a fixed wing mode, this mode will perform a "
"descending fixed wing LOITER down to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` and then "
"switch to :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`. If the aircraft was already "
"performing a loiter when switching to this mode the LOITER center does not "
"change, otherwise the LOITER center will become the same location it is at "
"when entering the mode."
msgstr ""
"如果上一个模式是固定翼模式，此模式将执行下降固定翼 LOITER 到 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，然后切换到 "
":ref:`QLAND 模式 <qland-mode>`。如果飞机在切换到此模式时已在盘旋，LOITER 中心不会改变，否则 LOITER "
"中心将成为进入模式时所在的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:9
#: e77c361624d2419fb5b364c04443a8f0
msgid ""
"the QLAND target will be directly below the point it switches to QLAND (ie "
"on the loiter circle path, not its center)"
msgstr "QLAND 目标将直接在切换到 QLAND 的点正下方（即在盘旋圆弧路径上，而非其中心）。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:11
#: 050ca617677d45eeaa7195e2177a322b
msgid ""
"If in a VTOL mode, or below  :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, when switching to "
"this mode, it will change immediately to :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"如果在切换到此模式时处于 VTOL 模式或低于 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，将立即切换到 :ref:`QLAND 模式 "
"<qland-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:13
#: b8641da033fc4124b580c7b68e656d44
msgid ""
"This is useful as a Battery Failsafe action to VTOL land the vehicle with as"
" little battery usage as possible if at higher altitudes than using "
":ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>` by itself."
msgstr ""
"这可用作电池失控保护动作，在高于使用 :ref:`QLAND 模式 <qland-mode>` 本身的高度时，以尽量少的电池消耗进行 VTOL 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:15
#: 151817abd22841e894e81bfc4e07de46
msgid ""
"The fixed wing loiter radius is set by :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"and descent rate is :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` until "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` is reached, and when reached, it will switch to "
":ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"固定翼盘旋半径由 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 设置，下降速率为 "
":ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>`，直到达到 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，到达后将切换到 :ref:`QLAND 模式 <qland-mode>`。"
